{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"function-row-toggleselected","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Function: row_toggleSelected()"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function row_toggleSelected<TFeatures, TData>(\n   row,\n   value?,\n   opts?): void;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-selection/rowSelectionFeature.utils.ts#L534","children":[{"type":"text","value":"features/row-selection/rowSelectionFeature.utils.ts:534"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Selects or deselects this row."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Omitting "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"value"},{"type":"text","value":" toggles the row. Child rows are selected recursively unless\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"opts.selectChildren"},{"type":"text","value":" is "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"false"},{"type":"text","value":", sub-row selection is disabled, or the row\nonly supports single selection. Pass "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"deselectParents: true"},{"type":"text","value":" to also remove\nancestor row ids from the selection when this row is deselected."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tfeatures","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TFeatures"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"../../index/interfaces/TableFeatures.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TableFeatures"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"../../index/type-aliases/RowData.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RowData"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"row","children":[{"type":"text","value":"row"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../../index/type-aliases/Row.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Row"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"value","children":[{"type":"text","value":"value?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"opts","children":[{"type":"text","value":"opts?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../../index/interfaces/ToggleSelectedOptions.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ToggleSelectedOptions"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"row_toggleSelected(row)\nrow_toggleSelected(row, true)\nrow_toggleSelected(row, false)\nrow_toggleSelected(row, true, { selectChildren: false })\nrow_toggleSelected(row, false, { deselectParents: true })","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"function-row-toggleselected","text":"Function: row_toggleSelected()","level":1},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tfeatures","text":"TFeatures","level":3},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"row","text":"row","level":3},{"id":"value","text":"value?","level":3},{"id":"opts","text":"opts?","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Function: row\\_toggleSelected()\n\n```ts\nfunction row_toggleSelected<TFeatures, TData>(\n   row,\n   value?,\n   opts?): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/row-selection/rowSelectionFeature.utils.ts:534](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-selection/rowSelectionFeature.utils.ts#L534)\n\nSelects or deselects this row.\n\nOmitting `value` toggles the row. Child rows are selected recursively unless\n`opts.selectChildren` is `false`, sub-row selection is disabled, or the row\nonly supports single selection. Pass `deselectParents: true` to also remove\nancestor row ids from the selection when this row is deselected.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](../../index/interfaces/TableFeatures.md)\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* [`RowData`](../../index/type-aliases/RowData.md)\n\n## Parameters\n\n### row\n\n[`Row`](../../index/type-aliases/Row.md)\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`\\>\n\n### value?\n\n`boolean`\n\n### opts?\n\n[`ToggleSelectedOptions`](../../index/interfaces/ToggleSelectedOptions.md)\n\n## Returns\n\n`void`\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nrow_toggleSelected(row)\nrow_toggleSelected(row, true)\nrow_toggleSelected(row, false)\nrow_toggleSelected(row, true, { selectChildren: false })\nrow_toggleSelected(row, false, { deselectParents: true })\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: row_toggleSelected\ntitle: row_toggleSelected\n---\n\n# Function: row\\_toggleSelected()\n\n```ts\nfunction row_toggleSelected<TFeatures, TData>(\n   row,\n   value?,\n   opts?): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/row-selection/rowSelectionFeature.utils.ts:534](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-selection/rowSelectionFeature.utils.ts#L534)\n\nSelects or deselects this row.\n\nOmitting `value` toggles the row. Child rows are selected recursively unless\n`opts.selectChildren` is `false`, sub-row selection is disabled, or the row\nonly supports single selection. Pass `deselectParents: true` to also remove\nancestor row ids from the selection when this row is deselected.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](../../index/interfaces/TableFeatures.md)\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* [`RowData`](../../index/type-aliases/RowData.md)\n\n## Parameters\n\n### row\n\n[`Row`](../../index/type-aliases/Row.md)\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`\\>\n\n### value?\n\n`boolean`\n\n### opts?\n\n[`ToggleSelectedOptions`](../../index/interfaces/ToggleSelectedOptions.md)\n\n## Returns\n\n`void`\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nrow_toggleSelected(row)\nrow_toggleSelected(row, true)\nrow_toggleSelected(row, false)\nrow_toggleSelected(row, true, { selectChildren: false })\nrow_toggleSelected(row, false, { deselectParents: true })\n```\n"}
